					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3880104,
					"content": "雖然手裡只有一把普通的木琴…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3880105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3880105,
					"content": "但要打破這種風障，也用不上「天空」——咦？那是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3880106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "溫迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 3880106,
					"content": "敵襲！各位，準備迎戰。",
